  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.10 — Package listing accommodation lines omit hotel links (package cards link to the package); detail pages keep hotel links. 1.0.9 — Extract Facebook/Instagram/LinkedIn/Twilio posting into non-packable almotawifSocial (#2304); drop those ProjectReferences from the published graph. 1.0.8 — Remove mailingList from published dependency graph (invert-ownership pilot #2238); IListUnsubscribeLookup for audience display. Content + common remain published peers. 1.0.7 — Depend on net3000.servicecoordinator 1.0.2 / net3000.google 1.0.2 (IGoogleTokenStore) to fix consumer ReflectionTypeLoadException. 1.0.6 — Depend on servicecoordinator 1.0.1 (SocialPosts). 1.0.5 — Expose seatsAvailable; decouple from legacy monolith. 1.0.4 — Fix package detail pricing after JSON round-trip. 1.0.3 — Rebuilt against net3000.common 10.0.21. 1.0.2 — Stop leaking netlibCore. 1.0.1 — Fix TwilioService PackageId. 1.0.0 — Initial release.",
